       CALL-ZUW01KL8-001.
               CALL 'ZUW01KL8' USING DFHCOMMAREA
                         WS-STATUS-CODE.
               IF WS-RESP NOT = DFHRESP(NORMAL)
                  MOVE ' LINK ZUW01KL8 FAILED' TO EM-VARIABLE
